WEBVTT

00:04.350 --> 00:05.860
In the World Beyond,

00:06.210 --> 00:08.520
humans take Potions

00:09.030 --> 00:11.670
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:11.670 --> 00:14.700
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.490
All 22 Pathways

00:18.490 --> 00:20.520
begin from Sequence 9,

00:21.420 --> 00:23.210
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:23.840 --> 00:25.990
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:27.260 --> 00:28.780
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:29.500 --> 00:32.780
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

00:33.790 --> 00:36.300
And such Pathways are called

00:37.210 --> 00:39.780
Pathways to Divinity.

00:51.500 --> 00:53.510
(September 9, 1349,
Fifth Epoch: The Iron Age)

00:53.510 --> 00:55.820
(The Doomsday of Tingen)

01:02.080 --> 01:03.520
The world is void.

01:04.840 --> 01:07.040
The chaos is eternal.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.600
The supreme being grants blessings

01:12.280 --> 01:13.680
with corruption,

01:15.800 --> 01:17.240
filth,

01:18.760 --> 01:20.200
and darkness.

01:24.040 --> 01:26.760
In a futile, faint struggle,

01:28.360 --> 01:29.800
the unknown awakens.

01:30.760 --> 01:32.840
Bearing the charge of blasphemy,

01:34.320 --> 01:37.400
the shepherd reverently crawls.

01:38.800 --> 01:41.600
I will sacrifice all the lambs

01:42.400 --> 01:44.440
to welcome your

01:45.800 --> 01:49.360
divine descent.

01:50.360 --> 01:53.540
=Episode 1=
(The Fool: I Open My Eyes Amid Mysteries)

02:07.880 --> 02:09.640
(It hurts.)

02:24.960 --> 02:26.960
(Two months ago, June 28, 1349,
Fifth Epoch: The Iron Age)

02:26.960 --> 02:27.920
Where am I?

02:28.960 --> 02:29.840
A nightmare?

02:31.140 --> 02:32.010
A gun?

02:36.490 --> 02:37.380
It hurts so much.

02:38.880 --> 02:40.080
A cerebral hemorrhage?

02:41.080 --> 02:42.080
Overwork death?

02:46.520 --> 02:47.370
Klein.

02:47.690 --> 02:48.550
Who is it?

02:50.640 --> 02:51.640
Who is Klein?

02:58.240 --> 02:59.360
This is not me.

03:00.880 --> 03:01.880
Klein...

03:03.800 --> 03:04.650
I've

03:05.920 --> 03:07.040
transmigrated...

03:16.040 --> 03:16.900
Status.

03:17.640 --> 03:19.640
Captain, two deceased.

03:20.780 --> 03:21.670
Welch

03:21.670 --> 03:22.570
and Naya.

03:23.680 --> 03:25.000
History graduates of Hoy University.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.000
Given the traces at the scene,

03:28.260 --> 03:29.130
it's suicide.

03:29.990 --> 03:30.830
But

03:31.280 --> 03:32.960
there should have been a dark divination

03:33.320 --> 03:34.400
or a Beyonder Sacrifice,

03:35.840 --> 03:36.800
leading to some kind

03:37.600 --> 03:38.760
of evil force's arrival.

03:41.400 --> 03:42.240
This is...

03:44.800 --> 03:45.760
Klein Moretti.

03:46.880 --> 03:47.760
The deceased's classmate.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.680
His parents died.

03:50.360 --> 03:51.840
He lives with his elder brother
and younger sister.

03:54.560 --> 03:55.800
(Klein Moretti.)

03:56.320 --> 03:57.640
(From Tingen City, Awwa County)

03:57.840 --> 03:59.480
(of Loen Kingdom on Northern Continent.)

04:00.400 --> 04:01.560
(A new history graduate)

04:02.000 --> 04:03.320
(mastering ancient Feysac language)

04:03.720 --> 04:04.640
(and Hermes language.)

04:05.800 --> 04:06.800
(On May 29th,)

04:07.120 --> 04:08.320
(Welch found me)

04:08.840 --> 04:10.920
(and said he acquired
an ancient notebook.)

04:11.880 --> 04:12.720
(On June 20th,)

04:13.360 --> 04:15.080
(we deciphered the first page:)

04:15.760 --> 04:16.920
(My goddess.)

04:17.600 --> 04:19.160
(It's a notebook from the Fourth Epoch)

04:20.040 --> 04:21.520
(by someone from a family called...)

04:22.920 --> 04:24.840
The Antigonus family.

04:25.920 --> 04:26.920
(June 21st,)

04:27.200 --> 04:28.640
(22nd, 25th...)

04:29.360 --> 04:30.480
Antigonus?

04:32.280 --> 04:33.120
(Black Emperor.)

04:33.760 --> 04:34.800
(Tudor Dynasty.)

04:36.040 --> 04:37.760
(Main peak of the Hornakis Mountains.)

04:39.760 --> 04:40.760
(June 26th.)

04:41.760 --> 04:43.640
(Are all these strange things true?)

04:45.680 --> 04:46.840
(Now it is the 28th.)

04:47.600 --> 04:49.200
(Why is there no entry for the 27th?)

04:55.360 --> 04:56.420
(Everyone will die.)
(Hermes language?)

04:57.800 --> 04:59.280
(Everyone will die,)

05:00.720 --> 05:01.600
(including me?)

05:02.720 --> 05:04.560
(Why would Klein write this?)

05:05.400 --> 05:06.320
(What happened to him?)

05:06.920 --> 05:07.760
Klein.

05:21.240 --> 05:23.980
(Melissa Moretti,
Klein's younger sister)

05:23.980 --> 05:26.840
(A student in Tingen Technical School)

05:26.840 --> 05:28.600
You stayed up all night reading again?

05:30.120 --> 05:31.000
What are you doing?

05:32.960 --> 05:34.480
I just woke up. Just tidying up.

05:36.160 --> 05:37.360
So mysterious.

05:39.140 --> 05:40.010
What's wrong?

05:44.840 --> 05:46.160
This seems to be

05:47.440 --> 05:48.330
broken again.

05:52.960 --> 05:55.280
(Why does she feel like
a mix of disdain and helplessness?)

05:57.240 --> 05:59.240
(Pulling up?
Shouldn't it be setting the time?)

06:05.900 --> 06:06.740
Done.

06:09.040 --> 06:09.920
(What's that?)

06:10.560 --> 06:11.960
(The care for her silly brother?)

06:16.480 --> 06:17.760
(The wound has almost healed.)

06:18.600 --> 06:20.080
(The transmigration's healing aura?)

06:22.520 --> 06:24.080
(A shot at the temple.)

06:25.360 --> 06:27.560
(A suicide, or a faked one?)

06:28.740 --> 06:30.150
(Though Klein's remaining memories)

06:30.150 --> 06:31.060
(are scattered,)

06:31.320 --> 06:32.720
(lacking a lot of key information,)

06:34.240 --> 06:35.110
(it is certain)

06:35.480 --> 06:37.480
(that it was related
to that ancient notebook.)

06:39.240 --> 06:40.140
(And)

06:40.440 --> 06:41.320
(my transmigration?)

06:43.160 --> 06:44.680
(Everything was normal.)

06:46.840 --> 06:48.280
(Just got a bit unlucky with work.)

06:50.150 --> 06:51.050
(Right.)

06:51.600 --> 06:53.120
(I did a luck-changing ritual.)

06:53.120 --> 06:53.960
(Qin-Han Occult)

06:57.420 --> 06:58.310
Klein.

07:01.840 --> 07:03.520
If you're in a daze, go back to sleep.

07:04.520 --> 07:05.720
It's okay. I'm fine.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.360
Alright then, I'm going to school.

07:09.760 --> 07:10.600
Buy some new bread.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.440
Just eight pounds.

07:11.960 --> 07:13.400
It's hot. The food spoils soon.

07:17.600 --> 07:19.520
Oh, and also lamb and peas.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.360
Job hunting is tiring.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.240
I'll make you lamb stew with peas.

07:26.480 --> 07:27.560
I'll be a bit late today.

07:27.910 --> 07:28.760
Wait for me.

07:36.440 --> 07:37.440
Sorry, Melissa.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.560
I can't wait for you to come back.

07:44.360 --> 07:45.760
(A revolver was absolutely loud.)

07:46.560 --> 07:48.720
(But Melissa didn't notice at all
just a wall away.)

07:50.920 --> 07:52.640
(This place is absolutely dangerous.)

07:53.400 --> 07:55.040
(I should try the luck-changing ritual)

07:55.960 --> 07:56.960
(to see if I can return.)

07:59.760 --> 08:01.720
(I hope to have dinner
at my own home today.)

08:05.800 --> 08:06.700
Mrs. Sline,

08:06.960 --> 08:07.800
eight pounds of bread.

08:08.960 --> 08:09.960
Little Klein,

08:10.200 --> 08:11.520
you've graduated, right?

08:12.160 --> 08:13.640
Yes, Mrs. Sline.

08:14.160 --> 08:16.240
What an outstanding young man.

08:16.760 --> 08:18.800
I believe you'll earn money soon

08:19.120 --> 08:20.280
and get a new place.

08:20.840 --> 08:23.440
You shouldn't be living
in an apartment like this.

08:25.360 --> 08:27.480
At least you should have your own

08:27.800 --> 08:28.640
bathroom.

08:31.270 --> 08:32.170
Mrs. Sline,

08:32.720 --> 08:34.880
you look like
a young and lively lady today.

08:37.880 --> 08:38.880
Goodbye, Mrs. Sline.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.320
Goodbye,

08:40.320 --> 08:41.240
Little Klein.

08:54.040 --> 08:59.910
(Iron Cross Street,
Tingen City, Loen Kingdom)

09:04.600 --> 09:06.000
(The sun looks about the same.)

09:07.480 --> 09:09.040
(If it weren't for
the weird crimson moon,)

09:09.680 --> 09:11.400
(it would look
like Earth's parallel world.)

09:21.770 --> 09:22.730
A pair of threes.

09:24.200 --> 09:26.280
- A pair of tens.
- A pair of jacks.

09:26.730 --> 09:27.660
Pass.

09:27.980 --> 09:28.900
Fight the Landlord?

09:30.000 --> 09:32.400
(Right, this world
has Fight the Landlord.)

09:33.040 --> 09:34.000
(It seems like)

09:34.520 --> 09:35.880
(over a hundred years ago,)

09:36.000 --> 09:37.160
(Emperor of Intis,)

09:37.720 --> 09:39.920
(Roselle Gustav, invented it.)

09:40.960 --> 09:42.680
(He also invented tarot divination)

09:42.980 --> 09:43.910
(and steam engines,)

09:44.440 --> 09:45.360
(improved the sailboats,)

09:45.960 --> 09:47.760
(and promoted
the Chinese New Year tradition.)

09:49.760 --> 09:51.000
(Considering the usual plot,)

09:51.400 --> 09:52.440
(Emperor Roselle)

09:53.160 --> 09:54.600
(may be a predecessor transmigrator)

09:55.120 --> 09:56.960
(and a countryman
from my gourmet motherland.)

10:07.000 --> 10:07.840
(Circus performance?)

10:09.960 --> 10:11.680
Sir, tonight at seven o'clock,

10:12.160 --> 10:13.720
I look forward to your visit.

10:19.370 --> 10:20.260
Praise the goddess.

10:56.000 --> 10:57.680
Lost lamb,

10:58.400 --> 10:59.240
come.

10:59.800 --> 11:02.360
Come receive guidance for your path.

11:09.210 --> 11:10.630
(Riggins)

11:18.760 --> 11:19.690
(Where is he?)

11:20.400 --> 11:22.080
Destiny is profound.

11:22.080 --> 11:23.520
Its trajectory is unpredictable.

11:24.120 --> 11:25.640
Tarot can help you

11:26.240 --> 11:27.760
peer into the occult.

11:28.200 --> 11:29.060
Tarot?

11:29.720 --> 11:31.680
It's not much different
from the tarot on Earth.

11:32.640 --> 11:34.200
So Emperor Roselle is a predecessor.

11:34.960 --> 11:37.240
You are the first person today
to request a divination.

11:37.520 --> 11:38.380
It's free.

11:39.300 --> 11:40.170
Please sit.

11:42.800 --> 11:44.400
- It's free?
- Of course.

11:45.040 --> 11:46.600
Let's begin.

11:46.600 --> 11:47.500
Wait.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.000
Let me confirm again.

11:49.880 --> 11:51.120
And the interpretation?

11:51.680 --> 11:52.680
- Also free?
- Also...

11:54.840 --> 11:55.960
Also free.

11:57.320 --> 11:59.080
(The free things
are the most expensive.)

12:04.560 --> 12:05.720
What do you want to divine?

12:06.960 --> 12:10.160
The past, present, and future.

12:11.240 --> 12:13.160
Then please shuffle the cards once more

12:13.640 --> 12:15.360
and silently meditate on your question.

12:15.520 --> 12:16.360
I've meditated.

12:17.400 --> 12:18.280
Please begin.

12:26.680 --> 12:28.400
This card symbolizes your past.

12:29.040 --> 12:30.680
This card symbolizes your present.

12:31.400 --> 12:33.400
And this card symbolizes your future.

12:34.720 --> 12:36.440
Alright, Mr. Free.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.760
Which card would you like to see first?

12:41.260 --> 12:42.120
The present.

12:52.170 --> 12:53.220
(The Fool)

12:53.640 --> 12:55.120
The Fool.

13:03.720 --> 13:04.650
(The Fool,)

13:05.440 --> 13:06.560
(the No. 0 card of tarot.)

13:07.760 --> 13:09.640
(It contains all possible beginnings.)

13:11.080 --> 13:12.400
Why do you impersonate me again?

13:13.040 --> 13:14.000
Remember.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.120
You are just a beast tamer.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.400
(Well, well.)

13:17.920 --> 13:19.340
(The tamer,
not seeking to be a diviner,)

13:19.340 --> 13:20.380
(is not a good clown.)

13:20.560 --> 13:21.960
Go watch over your baboons.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.240
Don't do this again.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.080
Sir,

13:24.360 --> 13:25.440
my divination is actually

13:25.960 --> 13:26.800
quite accurate.

13:43.870 --> 13:46.440
(Lord of the Mysteries)

13:48.460 --> 13:53.540
(Seven orthodox beings
of the Northern Continent)

14:00.670 --> 14:02.220
(Talismans)

14:02.680 --> 14:03.760
Be it a luck-changing ritual

14:04.080 --> 14:05.120
or a transmigration one,

14:05.960 --> 14:07.920
please let me return home smoothly.

14:09.800 --> 14:11.200
(Place local staples)

14:11.200 --> 14:12.070
(in each corner.)

14:13.760 --> 14:14.600
(Stand in the center)

14:15.200 --> 14:17.320
(and walk a square
in four steps counterclockwise.)

14:26.120 --> 14:28.080
Immortal Worthy
of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.

14:31.240 --> 14:33.200
Majestic Worthy
of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.

14:36.280 --> 14:38.440
Venerable Worthy
of Heaven and Earth for Blessings

14:44.200 --> 14:45.240
Celestial Worthy

14:45.760 --> 14:46.760
of Heaven and Earth

14:47.480 --> 14:48.390
for Blessings.

14:51.210 --> 14:52.460
(Awwa County Police Department)

15:06.040 --> 15:06.890
(No reaction?)

15:07.750 --> 15:08.650
(That's odd.)

15:09.540 --> 15:10.380
(Just now...)

15:15.680 --> 15:16.600
Not seeking death

15:17.160 --> 15:18.520
won't lead to death.

15:21.400 --> 15:24.710
(Celestial Worthy of Heaven...)

15:56.230 --> 15:57.100
(Where)

15:57.960 --> 15:58.890
(am I now?)

16:08.440 --> 16:09.360
Mirror, mirror,

16:10.080 --> 16:11.560
in the name of the Hall family,

16:11.820 --> 16:12.710
I order you

16:13.240 --> 16:14.120
to awaken.

17:18.000 --> 17:18.860
Sir,

17:19.200 --> 17:20.040
excuse me.

17:20.280 --> 17:21.130
Where is this place?

17:21.600 --> 17:22.760
(These two people are)

17:23.690 --> 17:24.620
(summoned by me?)

17:28.640 --> 17:29.510
Excuse me,

17:30.080 --> 17:31.800
are you the master of this divine realm?

17:33.160 --> 17:34.020
(Divine realm?)

17:35.440 --> 17:36.920
(Can it be called a divine realm)

17:37.440 --> 17:38.400
(without even a temple?)

17:58.800 --> 18:00.480
(The legendary Word-Bound Reality)

18:00.760 --> 18:01.640
(and Manifestation.)

18:02.720 --> 18:03.560
(Could it be)

18:03.760 --> 18:04.650
(that this gray mist)

18:05.280 --> 18:06.760
(is a cheat)

18:07.370 --> 18:08.230
(I can use?)

18:15.720 --> 18:16.560
(As expected.)

18:16.560 --> 18:17.420
Sir.

18:18.410 --> 18:19.300
May I ask,

18:20.440 --> 18:21.440
what is this place?

18:22.020 --> 18:22.890
And who

18:23.270 --> 18:24.170
are you?

18:25.040 --> 18:25.930
(Me?)

18:33.160 --> 18:34.180
(Am I Zhou Mingrui)

18:34.500 --> 18:35.360
(or Klein?)

18:52.520 --> 18:53.880
You can call me

18:59.720 --> 19:00.740
The Fool.

19:03.320 --> 19:04.300
The Fool?

19:05.640 --> 19:06.500
Mr. Fool,

19:07.440 --> 19:09.280
what do you want to do?

19:10.160 --> 19:11.240
An attempt.

19:12.040 --> 19:12.960
An attempt?

19:17.000 --> 19:17.900
Mr. Fool,

19:18.360 --> 19:19.360
have you finished it?

19:20.000 --> 19:21.520
Can you let us go back?

19:22.820 --> 19:23.720
Of course.

19:24.280 --> 19:25.680
If you formally ask for it,

19:26.360 --> 19:28.360
I can let you go back now.

19:29.840 --> 19:30.880
(She sounds)

19:31.120 --> 19:32.280
(like an innocent girl.)

19:33.520 --> 19:34.410
(While the other one)

19:35.360 --> 19:36.960
(is calm and vigilant,)

19:38.000 --> 19:38.920
(with depth unknown.)

19:40.520 --> 19:42.040
What a wonderful experience!

19:43.160 --> 19:44.720
I've always wanted such an occult,

19:45.000 --> 19:46.200
supernatural miracle.

19:47.000 --> 19:47.910
Mr. Fool,

19:48.120 --> 19:48.960
what should I do

19:49.040 --> 19:50.180
to become a Beyonder?

19:50.180 --> 19:51.110
(Beyonder?)

19:52.080 --> 19:53.040
(Never heard of it.)

19:56.440 --> 19:57.440
For this question,

19:58.120 --> 19:59.000
this gentleman

19:59.480 --> 20:01.320
can give you a perfect answer.

20:04.320 --> 20:06.520
(The lady opposite
sounds like a Loen noble.)

20:07.360 --> 20:08.720
(While I am in the Sonia Sea.)

20:09.080 --> 20:09.920
(We're far apart.)

20:11.000 --> 20:12.360
(How did the Fool manage this?)

20:15.440 --> 20:16.400
You're from Loen, right?

20:17.320 --> 20:18.480
To become a Beyonder,

20:18.920 --> 20:20.200
join Evernight Goddess,

20:20.490 --> 20:21.350
Lord of Storms,

20:21.720 --> 20:22.840
or other organizations.

20:23.800 --> 20:25.120
Although most people won't see

20:25.440 --> 20:26.720
any Beyonder in their lifetime,

20:27.440 --> 20:28.960
Beyonders do exist.

20:29.840 --> 20:31.000
They are still fighting

20:31.360 --> 20:32.920
dangers crawling in the dark.

20:33.000 --> 20:33.860
But

20:34.400 --> 20:35.640
I don't want to lose my freedom.

20:36.560 --> 20:37.760
Then go to the royal family

20:38.560 --> 20:40.320
or find those millennial nobles.

20:41.440 --> 20:42.480
Is there no other way?

20:46.920 --> 20:47.760
I do have

20:48.640 --> 20:50.920
two Sequence 9 potion formulas

20:51.280 --> 20:52.880
- Sequence 9?
- Really? Which two?

20:54.120 --> 20:55.000
One is Sailor.

20:55.600 --> 20:56.720
The other is Spectator.

20:57.360 --> 20:58.760
You can gain keen observation.

20:59.560 --> 21:01.640
(Sounds like different types
of superpowers.)

21:02.720 --> 21:04.080
(And Sequence 9 is a power level.)

21:05.520 --> 21:06.440
(Are the gray mist)

21:07.080 --> 21:08.120
(and my transmigration)

21:09.160 --> 21:11.120
(also some kind of Beyonders' powers?)

21:12.560 --> 21:13.480
Mr. Fool,

21:14.000 --> 21:15.600
I have made a deal with this gentleman.

21:16.680 --> 21:18.160
Please forgive my abruptness.

21:18.880 --> 21:19.750
But could you

21:20.040 --> 21:21.400
bear witness to our deal?

21:21.920 --> 21:22.840
Sure.

21:24.520 --> 21:26.440
Do you mind
having a few more such gatherings?

21:26.760 --> 21:27.660
(Gatherings?)

21:28.680 --> 21:29.580
Mr. Fool,

21:30.560 --> 21:32.680
you possess powers
beyond our imagination.

21:33.360 --> 21:35.360
But that noble lady over there

21:35.840 --> 21:36.710
and I

21:37.160 --> 21:38.600
may help you with some trifles

21:39.280 --> 21:42.120
you might find inconvenient to handle
at some point in the future.

21:43.280 --> 21:44.360
(Frequent gatherings)

21:44.520 --> 21:45.640
(could expose my secrets.)

21:46.720 --> 21:48.120
(But the closer I'm to the occult,)

21:48.760 --> 21:50.200
(the more likely I'll go home.)

21:52.160 --> 21:54.120
(I must overcome the fear
caused by the unknown.)

21:55.680 --> 21:56.560
The gathering

21:57.720 --> 21:58.560
can be at 3 PM

21:58.720 --> 21:59.640
every Monday.

22:00.400 --> 22:01.440
Try to be alone then.

22:02.560 --> 22:03.430
You two continue.

22:06.160 --> 22:08.360
Then we should
give each of us a codename.

22:08.810 --> 22:10.680
We can't communicate using real names.

22:10.860 --> 22:11.720
Good idea.

22:18.240 --> 22:20.320
Since Mr. Fool is from the tarot...

22:23.400 --> 22:25.240
I've decided. My codename is

22:25.580 --> 22:26.440
(Audrey Hall, Justice of Tarot Club)
Justice.

22:28.800 --> 22:29.830
(Alger Wilson, Hanged Man of Tarot Club)
The Hanged Man.

22:30.800 --> 22:31.750
Then we...

22:31.920 --> 22:33.920
(It seems my energy
is not enough to sustain this.)

22:35.240 --> 22:36.320
It is said that at first,

22:36.680 --> 22:37.880
Emperor Roselle made

22:38.000 --> 22:39.520
another set of tarot cards.

22:39.840 --> 22:40.680
Yes.

22:41.160 --> 22:43.280
It's said Emperor Roselle
saw the Blasphemy Slates.

22:44.160 --> 22:45.000
And that set of cards

22:45.200 --> 22:47.560
holds the secrets
to the 22 Pathways to Divinity.

22:48.160 --> 22:49.030
Alright.

22:52.080 --> 22:53.600
That's all for today's gathering.

22:54.880 --> 22:55.920
We follow your will.

22:58.320 --> 22:59.180
We follow

22:59.600 --> 23:00.490
your will.

23:17.610 --> 23:18.540
Who is it?

23:19.240 --> 23:20.200
The police.

23:24.100 --> 23:24.970
Coming.

23:33.580 --> 23:34.500
(An inspector?)

23:37.880 --> 23:39.440
Sorry, I was just taking a nap.

23:40.680 --> 23:41.640
We meet again.

23:41.760 --> 23:42.600
You are the one

23:43.120 --> 23:44.600
who stalked me at the town square.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.020
Stalked?

23:46.600 --> 23:47.680
(Leonard Mitchell, Awwa County Police)
An interesting choice of words.

23:48.440 --> 23:50.040
Why couldn't it be protection?

23:51.720 --> 23:52.960
Awwa County Police Department,

23:53.360 --> 23:54.240
Leonard Mitchell.

23:55.040 --> 23:55.880
Why are you...

23:56.080 --> 23:58.080
Don't be nervous, Mr. Moretti.

24:02.280 --> 24:03.520
It's just a routine inquiry.

24:03.520 --> 24:05.030
(Dunn Smith, Awwa County Police)

24:10.540 --> 24:11.460
Officer,

24:12.240 --> 24:13.640
did Naya and Welch really

24:14.760 --> 24:15.620
commit suicide?

24:16.520 --> 24:17.640
By the traces at the scene,

24:18.220 --> 24:19.080
yes.

24:19.920 --> 24:21.040
(Those were suicides?)

24:21.680 --> 24:22.920
(They were being possessed.)

24:23.280 --> 24:24.280
What

24:24.520 --> 24:25.640
'strange thing'?

24:25.640 --> 24:26.480
You...

24:27.160 --> 24:28.010
And this phrase.

24:29.200 --> 24:30.600
Everyone will die,

24:30.960 --> 24:31.880
including me.

24:32.320 --> 24:33.160
What does that mean?

24:42.480 --> 24:44.840
I don't know. I really can't remember.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.200
Especially recent events.

24:48.320 --> 24:49.880
Evidence proves that on the 27th,

24:50.360 --> 24:51.880
you visited Welch McGovern's place.

24:52.800 --> 24:53.720
I've been there?

24:55.320 --> 24:56.760
You might not believe it.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.600
I rely entirely on my diary

24:58.720 --> 24:59.680
to barely guess it.

25:01.360 --> 25:03.840
Mr. McGovern lost a revolver.

25:05.560 --> 25:08.160
I think it should be here.

25:08.800 --> 25:10.240
Right, Mr. Moretti?

25:10.520 --> 25:11.520
It's in the stove.

25:13.320 --> 25:14.400
Nothing to add?

25:15.050 --> 25:15.940
Yes.

25:16.600 --> 25:17.520
Yesterday.

25:17.520 --> 25:18.360
I woke up at midnight

25:19.120 --> 25:20.600
and found myself lying on the desk.

25:21.280 --> 25:23.400
It looked like
I had been through a failed suicide.

25:24.480 --> 25:25.350
After that,

25:25.840 --> 25:27.200
I began to lose some memories.

25:27.560 --> 25:28.680
Good psychological quality.

25:29.200 --> 25:30.600
I think you can hear my sincerity.

25:32.040 --> 25:33.880
This indeed aligns with my speculation.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.850
However,

25:36.520 --> 25:37.480
my view doesn't matter.

25:38.480 --> 25:40.560
You must pass
an expert's psychic verification.

25:41.510 --> 25:42.380
She

25:43.320 --> 25:45.640
should be able to help you
recall the lost memories.

25:46.480 --> 25:47.440
(A psychic expert?)

25:48.200 --> 25:49.880
(Will they extract my Earth memories?)

25:50.040 --> 25:50.880
You are very lucky.

25:52.800 --> 25:54.720
We are glad to see you're still alive.

25:55.760 --> 25:57.000
After all, generally speaking,

25:57.520 --> 25:58.600
encountering such an event,

25:59.320 --> 26:00.920
everyone involved being dead

26:01.480 --> 26:02.380
is the norm.

26:21.440 --> 26:23.160
What's wrong, Mr. Moretti?

26:25.000 --> 26:26.800
(What if they discover
I'm a transmigrator?)

26:27.320 --> 26:28.230
Stop.

26:28.840 --> 26:29.740
Darn it.

26:30.040 --> 26:31.040
You little rascal.

26:31.400 --> 26:32.300
Stealing every day.

26:33.560 --> 26:35.560
Stop. Catch him.

26:37.900 --> 26:38.760
Let go of me.

26:40.520 --> 26:41.880
Finally caught you.

26:42.320 --> 26:44.120
Just have him return
what he took from you.

26:44.120 --> 26:46.440
Let go of me, or I'll curse you.

26:50.120 --> 26:51.000
(A chance.)

26:51.000 --> 26:51.980
Let go.

27:25.080 --> 27:26.280
Time and space stop?

27:32.320 --> 27:33.280
There is a Beyonder.

28:03.000 --> 28:03.880
To the dock.

28:05.060 --> 28:05.900
Okay.

28:15.680 --> 28:17.920
(No car chases or anomalies.)

28:18.520 --> 28:19.360
Please stop up ahead.

28:25.290 --> 28:26.150
Where are you going?

28:26.800 --> 28:28.200
Welch's residence.

28:39.720 --> 28:40.650
(It was a dream.)

28:41.440 --> 28:42.640
(When did I fall asleep?)

28:59.000 --> 29:00.120
Let me reintroduce myself.

29:00.120 --> 29:01.160
(Dunn Smith, Nighhawks,
Evernight Goddess)

29:01.160 --> 29:02.020
I'm a Nighthawk,

29:02.840 --> 29:04.480
Dunn Smith.

29:05.900 --> 29:06.790
(Just now,)

29:07.280 --> 29:08.680
(he was manipulating the dream.)

29:09.720 --> 29:10.680
(He is a Beyonder.)

29:12.000 --> 29:12.920
Mr. Moretti,

29:13.800 --> 29:14.720
in the night,

29:15.480 --> 29:17.840
we are far stronger than you imagine.

29:18.280 --> 29:19.210
We?

29:29.360 --> 29:30.280
No need to be nervous.

29:31.560 --> 29:34.080
I will provide you
with enough gentleness and lubrication

29:35.080 --> 29:37.040
to let you slowly open up.

29:37.440 --> 29:38.960
(No.)

29:39.120 --> 29:39.980
Don't worry.

29:40.560 --> 29:42.120
She just wants to calm you down.

29:42.860 --> 29:43.720
She

29:44.280 --> 29:46.000
likes corpses more than men.

30:06.800 --> 30:08.560
Mom. Dad.

30:09.280 --> 30:10.120
Klein.

30:13.920 --> 30:15.720
A surface memory can be erased,

30:16.800 --> 30:18.080
but in the ocean of the mind,

30:19.000 --> 30:21.200
there must be its residual projection.

30:21.720 --> 30:22.730
(She saw it?)

30:23.750 --> 30:25.880
(No, she didn't find out.)

30:26.680 --> 30:27.520
(According to her,)

30:28.080 --> 30:29.400
(this is my mind world.)

30:30.240 --> 30:31.640
(Yet she couldn't see my secrets.)

30:32.640 --> 30:33.480
(Could it be because)

30:34.160 --> 30:35.000
(of this gray mist?)

30:36.480 --> 30:37.450
Klein,

30:38.160 --> 30:39.020
tell me,

30:39.760 --> 30:42.000
where did you take

30:42.600 --> 30:43.720
Antigonus Family's Notebook?

30:44.080 --> 30:45.040
(The notebook is gone?)

30:46.400 --> 30:47.240
I don't know.

30:48.000 --> 30:49.800
On June 27th,

30:50.680 --> 30:52.760
what happened at the Welch's place?

30:53.720 --> 30:54.600
Welch...

30:55.680 --> 30:56.550
Naya...

30:57.720 --> 30:58.600
I don't know.

30:59.120 --> 31:00.880
When they died,

31:01.880 --> 31:04.120
what exactly were you doing?

31:05.520 --> 31:06.380
I...

31:26.120 --> 31:27.160
(Did I)

31:27.160 --> 31:28.080
(pass?)

31:28.080 --> 31:29.760
Three points can be confirmed for now.

31:30.200 --> 31:31.280
He had shot himself.

31:31.880 --> 31:32.880
He is indeed alive.

31:33.960 --> 31:35.720
As for the part of the memory he lost,

31:36.240 --> 31:38.160
like the spirits of Welch and Naya,

31:38.800 --> 31:40.040
it left no trace.

31:41.880 --> 31:43.080
The power affecting him

31:43.200 --> 31:44.240
(Daly Simone, Nighhawks, Evernight Goddess)
inspires fear.

31:44.960 --> 31:47.400
I have never encountered
something so tricky.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.490
You

31:52.840 --> 31:53.830
must be careful.

31:56.200 --> 31:58.360
Antigonus Family's Notebook
is still missing.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.480
You are still in danger.

32:03.110 --> 32:03.960
Then I...

32:03.960 --> 32:05.160
We are not your babysitters.

32:06.240 --> 32:07.160
We can't always protect you.

32:10.120 --> 32:10.980
Or

32:12.440 --> 32:13.600
do you want to join us

32:14.440 --> 32:15.320
and become

32:15.840 --> 32:16.880
a Beyonder?

33:05.400 --> 33:10.590
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

33:11.380 --> 33:19.140
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

33:19.420 --> 33:22.790
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

33:23.010 --> 33:26.220
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

33:26.430 --> 33:32.010
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

33:32.010 --> 33:35.210
♪Wonder or dismay♪

33:35.210 --> 33:38.830
♪Madness or decay♪

33:39.360 --> 33:41.410
♪With fragile light♪

33:41.410 --> 33:45.480
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

33:45.480 --> 33:49.140
♪Stirring or delay♪

33:49.140 --> 33:52.460
♪Rebirth or be same♪

33:53.020 --> 33:58.290
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

33:58.560 --> 34:02.120
♪Fade away♪
